brane-deployment prohject structure                                                                           
==================================
brane-docker-deployment/
├── inventories/
│   └── production/
│       └── hosts.ini            # Defines VM host IPs and deployment variables
├── roles/
│   ├── docker_setup/               # Role to provision the multi-node K3s cluster
│   │   └── tasks/
│   │       └── main.yml
│   └── brane_central           # Role to configure and start the Central Hub (VM 1)
│       └── tasks/ 
│         └── main.yml
│   └── brane_workers/           # Role to configure and start Worker Nodes (VM 2 & 3)
│       └── tasks/
│          └── main.yml
├── group_vars/
│   └── all.yml                  # Global configurations (versions, chart paths)
└── deploy.yml                   # The master playbook driving the entire execution
====

